Verified by independent read-only inspection and bounded hashing/arithmetic:

- Packet: **13,225 bytes**, SHA256 `810f743b2d6c7b6238cbce4a15ac8641aaffb839ffba3cc178357de75a462fd5`.
- Typed source manifest: SHA256 `36c202deeae26da9dcf458717546454992f905438224fb2f9d55eae29e2b17b1`.
